{"suttaId":"thi-ap2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6598,6614],"vripara":"20"},"segments":{"thi-ap2:0.3":"Mekhalādāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap2:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, thūpakārāpikā ahuṃ [thūpakāra makāsahaṃ (syā.)];","thi-ap2:1.3":"Mekhalikā mayā dinnā, navakammāya satthuno.","thi-ap2:2.1":"“Niṭṭhite ca mahāthūpe, mekhalaṃ punadāsahaṃ;","thi-ap2:2.3":"Lokanāthassa munino, pasannā sehi pāṇibhi.","thi-ap2:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ mekhalamadaṃ tadā;","thi-ap2:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, thūpakārassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap2:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap2:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap2:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap2:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ mekhalādāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap2:8.1":"Mekhalādāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
